WEBVTT

00:00:02.018 --> 00:00:05.886
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.289 --> 00:00:10.157
Delivers this message

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:19.161
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.303 --> 00:00:20.770
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:28.879
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:29.174
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.412 --> 00:00:36.682
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:41.050
But please don't look back

00:00:41.191 --> 00:00:45.218
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.428 --> 00:00:49.524
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:53.235
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.503 --> 00:00:57.405
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:01.402
Delivers this message

00:01:01.845 --> 00:01:10.082
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.453 --> 00:01:18.656
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.095 --> 00:01:28.766
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:32.409 --> 00:01:36.140
Seiran and Sakujun Sa are casting
dice with their lives at stake.

00:01:37.247 --> 00:01:39.579
The dice will determine which of the
two will be first to drink the poison.

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.445
With the revelation of the
various improprieties...

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:46.784
...committed by the Sa Clan...

00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:50.652
...everyone connected to the clan,
without exception, has been arrested.

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:56.499
In the midst of the chaos, Kokujun...

00:01:56.566 --> 00:01:59.034
...became the heir apparent to the
position of head of the Sa Clan.

00:01:59.302 --> 00:02:01.270
This meant that he would bear...

00:02:01.338 --> 00:02:04.068
...the heavy burden of guilt and
responsibility for his clan's sins.

00:02:05.141 --> 00:02:10.101
Every Meeting Ends in Parting

00:02:14.851 --> 00:02:16.819
Two-three.

00:02:18.722 --> 00:02:19.950
Here.

00:02:20.023 --> 00:02:23.754
Nine years ago it was you
who directed the murder...

00:02:24.327 --> 00:02:26.158
...of Shunki's parents,
the late Advisor Sa's son...

00:02:26.229 --> 00:02:27.457
...and daughter-in-law, wasn't it?

00:02:28.298 --> 00:02:31.290
There is just no way that
Chusho Sa, Advisor Sa's brother...

00:02:31.368 --> 00:02:33.734
...could have pulled it off on his own.

00:02:34.604 --> 00:02:35.764
Oh?

00:02:35.839 --> 00:02:38.831
I wouldn't be the least surprised
if some unproductive youngster...

00:02:39.609 --> 00:02:42.077
...fed up with Advisor Sa's frequent
interference with his amusement...

00:02:42.445 --> 00:02:47.280
...gave suggestions to Chusho Sa
as a form of a little revenge.

00:02:53.189 --> 00:02:55.589
That's a moderately interesting story.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:03:00.225
Don't you even want to hear the reason
why your father was brought down?

00:03:00.964 --> 00:03:03.489
It appears that hardship
makes people grow.

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:07.630
The former prince has become
quite skilled in small tricks.

00:03:08.371 --> 00:03:10.839
Shall we have a toast to your
pathetically sincere effort?

00:03:11.608 --> 00:03:13.576
Do as you wish.

00:03:15.178 --> 00:03:17.237
In grief for the former prince...

00:03:17.647 --> 00:03:22.016
...who has become cruel-tongued
and pessimistic, a toast!

00:03:28.491 --> 00:03:30.891
I had the Merchants Guild
investigate, and found out that the...

00:03:31.428 --> 00:03:34.488
...Sa Clan's main branch ordered
several kinds of incense at once.

00:03:35.332 --> 00:03:36.390
And?

00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:38.933
They were highly addictive...

00:03:39.002 --> 00:03:41.470
...and would gradually have a
certain effect on the mind.

00:03:43.039 --> 00:03:45.007
You're very knowledgeable.

00:03:45.108 --> 00:03:46.234
Of course, I take it...

00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:49.767
...you know the people who
ordered the incense, don't you?

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.148
Yeah. It was your
mother and grandmother.

00:03:54.217 --> 00:03:56.378
Well, those two
would quite likely do it.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:02.189
Chances are, an unproductive slacker
who knows strange, random things...

00:04:03.259 --> 00:04:05.625
...probably told them about it,
just to cope with his boredom.

00:04:08.932 --> 00:04:11.867
Well, indeed there are probably
kind people out there...

00:04:11.935 --> 00:04:14.768
...who would answer if
asked about such things.

00:04:18.441 --> 00:04:20.932
This is strong wine.
My throat's burning.

00:04:27.717 --> 00:04:29.014
It's finally over.

00:04:29.119 --> 00:04:30.916
Yeah. Job well done.

00:04:31.554 --> 00:04:34.318
You've done an ideal
job as governors.

00:04:34.891 --> 00:04:36.449
Thank you very much.

00:04:36.826 --> 00:04:37.349
Not yet.

00:04:39.229 --> 00:04:40.287
We're not finished here.

00:04:41.197 --> 00:04:43.529
I must get the flower bud pin
back from that man.

00:04:45.034 --> 00:04:45.830
Right.

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:50.036
I'll go and finish that final job!

00:04:54.043 --> 00:04:56.637
Will Shurei be all right
going on her own?

00:04:57.213 --> 00:05:01.707
That's Princess's problem. It's only
proper for her to get it back herself.

00:05:02.685 --> 00:05:03.982
Right.

00:05:04.053 --> 00:05:07.386
This is one thing we
cannot interfere with.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.765
Won't you tell me? Why are you...

00:05:22.839 --> 00:05:26.434
...or rather, why are the people
of this world so skillful?

00:05:27.944 --> 00:05:29.969
Skillful? What do you mean?

00:05:30.613 --> 00:05:33.081
I only need one person, and I
think that's perfectly fine.

00:05:33.616 --> 00:05:35.584
But the people of this world...

00:05:36.219 --> 00:05:40.155
...for example you, are different.

00:05:40.924 --> 00:05:42.357
You have your princess
whom you love...

00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:44.893
...as well as other people
whom you hold dear.

00:05:46.095 --> 00:05:48.063
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:59.108 --> 00:06:03.738
In the past, the only person I felt was
important to me was my little brother.

00:06:05.582 --> 00:06:09.450
However... Things are different now.

00:06:13.423 --> 00:06:15.948
I only have one person...

00:06:16.659 --> 00:06:19.856
...and I'm trying to give her,
and only her, all of myself.

00:06:22.665 --> 00:06:24.633
So I would prefer if people like you...

00:06:24.701 --> 00:06:27.169
...who have other people important
to you, would stop interfering.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.878
When it comes to me, Sakujun Sa...

00:06:36.813 --> 00:06:40.305
...if I may say so myself,
I'm quite selfish.

00:06:41.918 --> 00:06:45.012
I take everything I desire.
I don't choose.

00:06:45.722 --> 00:06:47.690
I'll take everything into my hands.

00:06:49.526 --> 00:06:52.757
If you become too greedy, you won't
get the things you really desire.

00:06:53.897 --> 00:06:55.865
You wouldn't understand.

00:06:56.499 --> 00:07:01.402
How much I truly love them,
and how fortunate I am for that.

00:07:02.405 --> 00:07:04.168
You're right. I don't understand.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.708
Although I don't really care
to understand either.

00:07:11.881 --> 00:07:13.849
Say... what would
you do if I told you...

00:07:13.917 --> 00:07:17.284
...that your princess
served me Gan Lu tea?

00:07:17.987 --> 00:07:21.423
I can only guess that you used
some cheap tactics to make her.

00:07:24.093 --> 00:07:26.823
My Lady's Gan Lu tea was
delicious, wasn't it?

00:07:28.398 --> 00:07:31.094
So this time, I'd like you
to make some Gan Lu for me.

00:07:31.668 --> 00:07:32.794
No way.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.838
Yes. It was very delicious.

00:07:45.348 --> 00:07:48.715
If you don't brew
Gan Lu tea for me, I'll die!

00:07:50.453 --> 00:07:54.048
That man. I wonder why he wanted
to drink Gan Lu tea so badly.

00:07:56.426 --> 00:07:58.394
I'll tell you one thing.

00:07:58.595 --> 00:08:00.153
I was told by My Lady that I'm her...

00:08:00.229 --> 00:08:01.491
...second-most favorite
person in the world.

00:08:03.132 --> 00:08:06.659
Why tell me that? That's hardly
worth bragging about.

00:08:09.305 --> 00:08:12.001
Her most favorite person is
a man whom no one can match.

00:08:14.177 --> 00:08:17.237
Is it all right if I ask you who
your number one favorite person is?

00:08:17.714 --> 00:08:19.614
Oh, it's Father.

00:08:19.682 --> 00:08:22.651
Even though he's a hopeless father,
he's always been my number one.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.588
That's why second place
is good enough for me.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.991
And don't tell me you don't
understand what I mean by that.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.220
You have a horrible
personality, as always.

00:08:33.763 --> 00:08:36.857
I wouldn't mind anyone at
all telling me that but you.

00:08:39.602 --> 00:08:40.591
I envy you.

00:08:40.737 --> 00:08:42.068
Huh?

00:08:42.338 --> 00:08:44.363
I said I envy you.

00:08:45.041 --> 00:08:49.444
I would love to be told by her that I'm,
say, her third most favorite in the world.

00:08:58.688 --> 00:09:02.624
His face is turning pale.
There's little time left.

00:09:04.827 --> 00:09:06.226
I'd like to ask you something.

00:09:06.329 --> 00:09:08.559
You sure have a lot of questions.

00:09:09.599 --> 00:09:12.762
Perhaps you wanted to become
better acquainted with me?

00:09:14.203 --> 00:09:16.728
If that were the case, you should've
said that from the beginning.

00:09:17.974 --> 00:09:20.306
I would've been able to
entertain you a little better.

00:09:23.212 --> 00:09:25.772
You properly returned the
flower to My Lady, did you?

00:09:26.516 --> 00:09:28.279
I returned it.

00:09:31.754 --> 00:09:33.654
Then I'm satisfied.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.250
I'll have you let me win this bet.

00:09:38.361 --> 00:09:40.329
You're joking, right?

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.903
You sure are unlikable, as always.

00:10:00.016 --> 00:10:02.746
Not as much as you, who would
put poison in all the cups.

00:10:03.386 --> 00:10:04.353
Very impressive.

00:10:09.225 --> 00:10:11.921
I prepared a tasteless,
odorless poison...

00:10:12.895 --> 00:10:16.763
...but you've come prepared to ensure
that you wouldn't lose, haven't you?

00:10:17.667 --> 00:10:19.601
I find that a little cowardly of you.

00:10:20.203 --> 00:10:22.603
Do you think I'd risk my life
with you as my opponent?

00:10:23.039 --> 00:10:25.803
You're only able to stand up to this
poison that takes immediate effect...

00:10:25.875 --> 00:10:28.343
...because you are using a
neutralizing antidote too.

00:10:29.045 --> 00:10:30.774
I used no such thing.

00:10:30.847 --> 00:10:34.146
It's just that I've tried so many
things over the years to kill time...

00:10:34.617 --> 00:10:36.585
...that my body's built
up a resistance.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:39.154
You monster!

00:10:48.765 --> 00:10:50.733
Are you all right?

00:10:56.405 --> 00:10:59.533
You have quite a strong
stomach for alcohol.

00:11:00.843 --> 00:11:04.574
To tell you the truth, I've made a
few small improvements to this wine.

00:11:05.648 --> 00:11:07.343
It's so strong...

00:11:07.416 --> 00:11:09.884
...even the heaviest of drinkers will fall
over after drinking just a single cup.

00:11:10.753 --> 00:11:13.449
For you to be able to drink
many cups of it nonchalantly...

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:16.520
...and only become dizzy now after
physically exerting yourself...

00:11:16.592 --> 00:11:18.560
Just what kind of body
do you have?

00:11:20.129 --> 00:11:22.154
Well, I'm sorry to
have to say goodbye...

00:11:22.732 --> 00:11:25.724
...but there's some place I have
to go, so I shall excuse myself.

00:11:26.536 --> 00:11:29.334
You just stay there and
have a little rest.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.050
If anyone were going to win
a bet against me...

00:11:43.119 --> 00:11:45.053
...that someone would not be you.

00:11:50.092 --> 00:11:55.052
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:14.951 --> 00:12:16.213
Shunki.

00:12:16.285 --> 00:12:20.187
Don't worry about anything.
I'm by your side.

00:12:20.823 --> 00:12:24.657
I'll always be with you. Always.

00:12:35.805 --> 00:12:37.773
There's no moon.

00:12:38.307 --> 00:12:41.071
That's right. It's a new
moon tonight.

00:13:29.191 --> 00:13:30.954
This will probably be the last time.

00:13:31.394 --> 00:13:33.862
As the governor, I must arrest
him and pass judgment on him.

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:36.430
That's why this will truly be...

00:13:38.734 --> 00:13:43.228
...the very last time that I'll be
able to meet him as Shurei Hong.

00:13:53.649 --> 00:13:56.243
I can hardly... move my
fingers anymore.

00:13:58.321 --> 00:14:01.017
Come here quickly, my princess.

00:14:02.391 --> 00:14:05.986
You never betray my expectations.
So come quickly.

00:14:18.908 --> 00:14:22.639
What are you doing in such
a hard-to-find place?

00:14:28.818 --> 00:14:30.786
Wai...

00:14:35.191 --> 00:14:37.159
Wh-What happened?

00:14:41.831 --> 00:14:43.799
What's going on?

00:14:45.601 --> 00:14:47.569
Are you sick?

00:14:52.008 --> 00:14:53.976
It was a promise.

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:56.278
The thing important to you.

00:14:57.847 --> 00:15:00.509
- This is no time for...!
- In the end...

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:04.347
In the end you only
gave me hot water.

00:15:10.359 --> 00:15:12.919
You've been drinking
wine. And a lot of it.

00:15:13.562 --> 00:15:15.530
If wine gets mixed with
Gan Lu tea in a weird way...

00:15:15.598 --> 00:15:17.088
...you could make yourself sick.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.964
Just have the hot water today
and have yourself a good sleep.

00:15:20.603 --> 00:15:24.004
If you don't brew
Gan Lu tea for me, I'll die!

00:15:26.008 --> 00:15:27.976
That's something a
child would say.

00:15:29.545 --> 00:15:31.479
You have to treat
your body properly...

00:15:31.547 --> 00:15:33.447
...so today I'll just pour
hot water for you.

00:15:35.651 --> 00:15:39.587
In that hot water, I had
added a slow acting poison...

00:15:40.689 --> 00:15:43.089
...that I'm not resistant to.

00:15:45.594 --> 00:15:48.062
But there was nothing
wrong with you yesterday!

00:15:48.964 --> 00:15:50.295
And also, I had chopped
up and added a...

00:15:50.366 --> 00:15:52.857
...neutralizing antidote to
the Gan Lu tea.

00:15:53.669 --> 00:15:56.570
You were just wandering around so
energetically. How could this be?

00:15:57.673 --> 00:16:00.107
When I said I'd die if you didn't
make Gan Lu tea for me...

00:16:00.176 --> 00:16:02.610
...I was telling the truth.

00:16:03.612 --> 00:16:06.706
Hey, this is because you scratched
your throat or something, right?

00:16:07.883 --> 00:16:10.351
I was thinking of telling
you the truth.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.688
That you're the one who killed me.

00:16:15.224 --> 00:16:18.057
If I did that then you
wouldn't forget me.

00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:21.863
I figured that I could become
a special person to you.

00:16:23.499 --> 00:16:26.297
Medicine! You don't have any
spare medicine on you, do you?

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.967
For the first time in my life...

00:16:30.039 --> 00:16:33.497
...I thought about what I could do
for the sake of someone else.

00:16:35.478 --> 00:16:39.175
But when I thought that, I realized
that no matter how I looked at it...

00:16:39.248 --> 00:16:41.216
...I was the greatest
hindrance to you.

00:16:43.052 --> 00:16:48.251
But since I was a little weak
I prepared a final gamble.

00:16:50.192 --> 00:16:52.717
You overcame it with ease.

00:16:55.831 --> 00:16:58.823
Why are you laughing?
Where's the medicine?

00:16:59.635 --> 00:17:04.595
I kept making you angry. Just once,
I would've liked to see you smile.

00:17:08.144 --> 00:17:10.442
- Where's the medicine?
- My eyes...

00:17:12.948 --> 00:17:16.145
The last thing to go
will be my hearing.

00:17:19.321 --> 00:17:21.312
I would like you to play
the erhu for me.

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:25.356
Quit joking with me!
Never mind! I'll go get Eigetsu!

00:17:27.997 --> 00:17:28.793
What?

00:17:28.864 --> 00:17:32.800
I've told you numerous times,
that this way is better.

00:17:44.647 --> 00:17:48.139
You never called me by my
real name, not even once.

00:17:52.188 --> 00:17:55.157
Let me go. I'll call Eigetsu.

00:17:57.726 --> 00:18:02.527
What place do I rank with you?

00:18:05.734 --> 00:18:07.702
Let me go, please.

00:18:22.218 --> 00:18:27.417
It's not your fault, but while I'm at it,
I'm giving you Sakujun Sa.

00:18:36.599 --> 00:18:39.466
Could this be my fault?

00:18:42.304 --> 00:18:44.568
They say that beauty and a
happy life rarely go together.

00:18:45.274 --> 00:18:47.970
Deadly illnesses always
strike the ideal man.

00:18:49.712 --> 00:18:51.873
I was planning on passing
away without saying this...

00:18:52.915 --> 00:18:54.883
...but now, at the very
final moment...

00:18:57.319 --> 00:18:59.287
I love you.

00:18:59.755 --> 00:19:02.952
And your playing the erhu,
making tea for me...

00:19:05.127 --> 00:19:07.095
...everything about you.

00:19:11.433 --> 00:19:14.197
I won't let you dodge the
subject by saying that!

00:19:15.037 --> 00:19:17.403
I won't allow you to say
that and then die!

00:19:18.173 --> 00:19:20.141
I won't call you by your name!

00:19:20.409 --> 00:19:23.936
What can I call you, anyway?
I only know to address you as master.

00:19:25.047 --> 00:19:28.244
You've never called me
by my real name either!

00:19:32.421 --> 00:19:34.321
Wait for me.

00:19:37.092 --> 00:19:39.560
You are the one person who
will win a bet against me.

00:19:40.829 --> 00:19:43.627
You really were special to me.

00:19:45.501 --> 00:19:48.629
When I die, I expected
to die with no regrets.

00:19:50.472 --> 00:19:52.940
They say that every
meeting ends in parting...

00:19:54.476 --> 00:19:56.410
...but still, I wanted you
to call my name.

00:19:57.946 --> 00:19:59.914
I wanted to hear you play
the erhu more.

00:20:01.216 --> 00:20:03.184
I wanted to spend
more time with you.

00:20:04.386 --> 00:20:07.321
I wanted to make you
say that you loved me.

00:20:16.031 --> 00:20:18.864
Where's... the moon?

00:20:28.444 --> 00:20:30.412
Tonight is a new moon.

00:20:30.846 --> 00:20:32.814
What's the matter, Your Majesty?

00:20:34.283 --> 00:20:35.875
Is there something out there?

00:20:35.951 --> 00:20:38.818
No, nothing. I just had
this strange feeling.

00:20:39.555 --> 00:20:42.080
Shurei came, and Seiran came...

00:20:42.991 --> 00:20:46.017
...and before I knew it,
I had what's important to me...

00:20:46.428 --> 00:20:48.692
...to the extent that the
darkness no longer bothers me.

00:20:49.131 --> 00:20:51.531
- Indeed.
- Of course...

00:20:52.201 --> 00:20:54.635
I also love you very much, Shuei.

00:20:55.504 --> 00:20:57.472
Thank you very much for that.
May I ask...

00:20:57.539 --> 00:21:00.201
...compared to Shurei, how do I rank?

00:21:00.976 --> 00:21:04.275
What do you mean?
You can't compare the two.

00:21:05.547 --> 00:21:09.483
Long ago, I thought it would be
enough just to have Elder Brother...

00:21:10.586 --> 00:21:12.850
...but now I feel that
would be such a waste.

00:21:13.622 --> 00:21:15.715
You're quite greedy, aren't you?

00:21:16.091 --> 00:21:18.719
A king is supposed to be greedy.

00:21:19.328 --> 00:21:21.296
Despite your greediness...

00:21:21.363 --> 00:21:24.730
...you've worked very hard
at restraining yourself.

00:21:26.034 --> 00:21:28.002
That's very impressive.

00:21:28.203 --> 00:21:32.139
Keep up the sweet talk, and I
might cry like a spoiled child.

00:21:32.775 --> 00:21:36.575
Right now I feel I'm wearing
a rather pathetic expression.

00:21:37.679 --> 00:21:40.079
That's very true. Very much so.

00:21:40.349 --> 00:21:42.442
But I like that.

00:21:43.685 --> 00:21:46.586
It's all right. We're here by your side.

00:21:51.727 --> 00:21:55.094
lf... I could see no one but Shurei...

00:21:56.198 --> 00:21:58.359
...I feel that until I meet her, this
world would be a terribly boring place...

00:21:58.934 --> 00:22:01.402
...and once we did meet, I'd make
up for it by living my life...

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:03.938
...like a candle burning
furiously until it burns out...

00:22:04.673 --> 00:22:06.641
...and I'd die alone.

00:22:07.109 --> 00:22:10.135
But if that were the case,
I'd likely have no regrets.

00:22:15.017 --> 00:22:16.507
Say, Shuei.

00:22:16.585 --> 00:22:21.079
I feel very fortunate to
have many people dear to me.

00:22:31.433 --> 00:22:32.627
Seiran!

00:22:32.701 --> 00:22:33.963
What's the matter?!

00:22:34.369 --> 00:22:36.667
My... My Lady...!

00:22:38.774 --> 00:22:40.207
I'll go and find her.

00:22:48.851 --> 00:22:50.819
Shurei!

00:22:52.554 --> 00:22:54.146
Thank goodness!
We were worried...

00:22:55.657 --> 00:22:57.625
Come quickly!

00:23:05.067 --> 00:23:08.434
You've never called me
by my real name either!

00:23:12.808 --> 00:23:14.776
Shu... rei...!

00:23:30.592 --> 00:23:35.689
You've always led a very carefree
life and right now

00:23:35.831 --> 00:23:42.395
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.504 --> 00:23:47.567
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.676 --> 00:23:52.670
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.749 --> 00:23:58.209
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.755 --> 00:24:04.886
You are just like me

00:24:05.627 --> 00:24:10.155
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.232 --> 00:24:16.137
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.105 --> 00:24:22.907
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.011 --> 00:24:27.880
I will always think of you

00:24:29.017 --> 00:24:41.691
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.100 --> 00:24:46.201
Next Episode

00:24:46.201 --> 00:24:47.436
Next Episode
What's the matter, Seiran?

00:24:47.436 --> 00:24:47.469
Next Episode

00:24:47.469 --> 00:24:50.539
Next Episode
All is Right with the World
You're so unsteady on your feet.
Come on, get your act together.

00:24:50.539 --> 00:24:51.273
Next Episode
All is Right with the World

00:24:51.273 --> 00:24:53.275
Next Episode
All is Right with the World
Okay, now to put an end
to this conflict...

00:24:53.275 --> 00:24:53.741
Okay, now to put an end
to this conflict...

00:24:53.842 --> 00:24:55.901
...let's go and save Yushun Tei!
